WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.502
A top Ukrainian official repeated today

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.371
that there will be no announcement

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:06.573
when this major counteroffensive against

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.340
Russia is underway.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.708
But also today,

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.309
a defense

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.211
ministry minister did note

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.113
that Ukrainian forces have, quote,

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.115
advanced in several directions

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:17.217
in the east in this long disputed

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:19.219
Donetsk region.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:20.487
The top general in the US,

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:21.788
the Joint Chiefs chairman Mark

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:22.922
Milley, said that he believes

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:25.091
Ukraine is ready for what lies ahead

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.462
So I think it's too early to tell

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.997
what outcomes are going to happen.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:31.865
I think the Ukrainians

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:32.799
are very well prepared,

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:33.967
as you know very well,

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.035
the United States and other

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:35.969
allied countries in Europe

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:36.803
and are really around

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:37.504
the world

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.138
have provided

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:40.473
training and ammunition and advice,

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:41.508
intelligence, etc.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.209
to the Ukrainians. We're supporting them.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.611
They're in a war

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.512
that's an essential threat

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:47.781
for the very survival of Ukraine

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:48.615
and has greater

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:50.283
meaning to the rest of the world

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.052
for for Europe,

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.453
really for the United States,

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:55.355
but also for the globe

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:58.658
And joining us now is

00:00:58.658 --> 00:00:59.526
CNN military

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:00.927
analyst, retired Air Force

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:02.862
Colonel Cedric Leighton.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:05.165
You heard what we are just hearing now

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:08.334
this Ukrainian offensive is taking place

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.669
in several directions,

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.805
according to an official.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:12.138
I mean,

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.940
are we seeing the beginnings of this?

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.974
I think we are, Brianna.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:15.575
And you know,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.710
when you're looking at the various places

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:18.445
that the Ukrainians

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.546
could attack,

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.214
you're basically looking at this area

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:22.215
right here,

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:23.917
this junction between the southern fronts

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.218
in the eastern front

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:26.853
you're also looking in the towards

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.088
the east right here

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.123
and potentially, potentially,

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:30.723
even though we haven't

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:31.858
heard much about it.

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:32.325
The area

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:34.661
just to the northeast of Kherson.

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.696
So these are the potential areas

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:37.931
where they can do this

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.332
on the map of Ukraine.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:40.800
But when you go beyond that,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.634
there's other stuff

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:42.602
obviously going on in

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:45.171
Russia and potentially anywhere else

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:46.506
the Ukrainians feel they need to.

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:47.740
Russia is claiming

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.809
they repelled a large scale attack.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:50.510
Right.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.512
Where you're talking about there.

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:55.348
Ukraine is has pretty much been mum.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:58.184
And we're seeing that they've emphasized

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.385
that being secretive.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:00.253
But at the same time,

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.488
I mean, you will see

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:02.455
sort of what's happening.

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.691
What do you make of of all of this

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:06.926
sort of the delay and the be quiet?

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.428
What do you make of it? Yes.

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:08.962
When it's

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:09.996
when people are quiet,

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:11.030
there is usually either

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.265
no good news to report

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:14.601
or they're keeping something

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.003
secret in order to do something else.

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:18.738
So in this particular case,

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.040
we're looking at several things going on

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.710
basically down here where I

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:24.511
the Russians,

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:26.646
we're talking about potentially

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:29.382
hurting the Ukrainians in this area.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:30.817
You also have the town of Lula Da,

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.418
which is a key point

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:33.853
where the Ukrainians are moving forward

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.656
and the very infamous city of Mahmoud

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:37.891
that we've been talking about for over

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:38.925
nine months now.

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:40.927
The Ukrainians are actually making gains

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:41.761
around Bermuda.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:42.962
And both sides are reporting

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:44.164
that this is happening.

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:46.299
So given that that's going on,

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.902
there's a lot of mixed messaging here.

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:50.470
And right now,

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:51.337
we really don't know

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.072
who's ahead or who is behind

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.908
but it's pretty clear that at the moment,

00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:55.942
the Ukrainians,

00:02:55.942 --> 00:02:56.743
for the most part,

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:59.145
are moving forward in certain areas,

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:00.280
including right here

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.447
and of Dufka as well.

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.049
Really fascinating reporting

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:04.250
from Natasha Bertrand

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.251
that you just heard about there,

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:08.788
these sabotage agents inside of Russia

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:12.125
that Ukraine is providing with drones.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.626
And there have been a lot of attacks.

00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:14.160
Hard to know

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.563
exactly who you attribute these to,

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:17.897
but we know that some of them

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:18.631
are attributable

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.200
to these sabotage agents.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.502
What do you make of this?

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:23.236
So Brianna,

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:25.271
you see a lot of symbolic attacks

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:26.206
like the one at the Three

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.307
Sisters Monument,

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:28.441
which is the tri point

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.543
between Belarus, Russia and Ukraine.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.612
That is an area

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.246
where the Russians

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:34.647
actually attacked this part.

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:35.782
However,

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:38.184
there's a symbolic piece to this.

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:39.152
You have the Ukrainians

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:41.321
doing things allegedly in Smolensk,

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:42.755
obviously in Moscow,

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:45.692
Kursk, varnish, and, of course, Belgorod.

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:46.492
Several attacks,

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:47.227
many attacks

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:48.962
right in this area right here.

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.096
And then you also have

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.631
the area around Mariupol.

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.499
So what the Ukrainians are doing is

00:03:53.499 --> 00:03:54.334
they're in essence,

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:55.768
shaping the battlefield.

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:56.803
They're keeping the Russians

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:58.171
off-balance by doing stuff

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:00.573
all over here in Russia itself,

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.041
while they are also

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:03.810
moving forces in Ukraine.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.111
So what they're doing here

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:06.312
is very different

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:07.447
from what they're doing over here.

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:09.382
This is an eventual warfare,

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:10.583
unconventional warfare

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.252
with the purpose of destabilize

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:13.019
opposing the Russians

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:14.921
and destabilizing the Russian response.

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:15.655
Can we look at

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:16.823
what's happening in Belgorod?

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:18.524
I know you have a video of this.

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:20.193
This is, of course,

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.694
the Russian side of the border.

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:23.763
This is where so many assets

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.398
were being sent into Ukraine

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:27.000
at the beginning of the war from Russia.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:27.967
What do you see happening?

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:29.235
So what you see here,

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:31.938
Brianna, is you're going after places

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:33.072
that look like

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:34.841
they might be supply depots.

00:04:34.841 --> 00:04:37.277
You also have areas in forested areas

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:39.679
where people would hide tanks,

00:04:39.679 --> 00:04:41.981
artillery emplacements, things like this.

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:42.949
A lot of this.

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:44.851
These are villages near Belgorod.

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:47.120
And in this particular case,

00:04:47.287 --> 00:04:48.788
you see

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:50.990
areas where there is movement forward

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:53.826
along routes like this one right here.

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:55.895
And they can try to interdict that.

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:56.462
The Ukrainians

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.131
going to try to stop movement on this

00:04:58.131 --> 00:04:59.332
by doing

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:01.334
some calculated moves in this area,

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:04.470
using their drones and other assets

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:05.305
to go in

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:07.307
and really make it rough for the Russians

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:08.041
in this area.

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:09.042
It is really interesting

00:05:09.042 --> 00:05:10.977
to see this battlefield expand

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:12.512
and to learn why it is.

00:05:12.512 --> 00:05:13.746
Thank you, Colonel, for taking

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:14.914
us through that. You bet it.

